{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1694.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"df1236d9537be90035a1843803aaacb4f62a5ca5a8edae71e2ea995831c8aca2","ja":"家族にお願い","zh":"拜托家人","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1694.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"49dc38bfc427a039ada749ba0056204f01caa8b2927872042f7ecb56e6e8de6f","ja":"わかった。それじゃあまた後でね。……律子さん！\nおかあさんがね、律子さんともお話ししたいって。","zh":"我知道了。那待会儿见。……律子小姐！\n妈妈说，她也想和律子小姐聊聊呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1694.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"42b7527dc99d92f7a1ea6411dc4e017644937fcd850fffaa324c0cdeb62af574","ja":"たまきのお母さんも、りつこと話したいんだって！\n電話してくれる？","zh":"环的妈妈也说想和律子说话呢！\n你能给她打个电话吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1694.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"62016e11406fb2fa93794e7f9931c13e3d57546c82aef82bebdc7ceacd9b9b4e","ja":"ええ、もちろん。じゃあちょっと待ってて。\nあっちのベンチで座って話してくるわね。","zh":"好的，当然可以。那稍等一下哦。\n我去那边的长椅坐着跟她说说。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1694.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"ef46587c9537ae8220999c23492eb0ad7beee1d4e3997a095b47a9bb60ddc903","ja":"もしもし……はい、ちょっと考えがあるので、\n私に任せていただけると……。","zh":"喂喂……嗯，我这边有些想法，\n要是能交给我来办的话……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1694.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"da73e35f44cc6e4ac015d85852de50e7a4cb0fec641c2cfd9b145236182331e6","ja":"一緒に年越ししていいって、言ってくれるといいな♪\nわたし、みんなでカウントダウンしたい！","zh":"要是能答应让我一起跨年就好了♪\n我想和大家一起倒计时！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1694.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"014da71fd45ea742ff53f369b27d1f8993159394bbc3d4fdb03ce8fa486aee9e","ja":"たまきも！　みんなにおめでとうって言うんだ。\nくふふ♪","zh":"环也要！向大家说恭喜。\n嘿嘿♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1694.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"e1d0c094869fb47db66e72de8c8cc1c4e5c147dfc927b58333b9310be8336cb1","ja":"あとあと、初日の出も見たい！\nぜったいきれいだよね！","zh":"还有还有，我也想看新年日出！\n肯定超级漂亮吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1694.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"b4d5b3b57eefb35c3ceb4e331a271ec1ac8e40c4d94a479735db5bcbe7886133","ja":"うん！　こんなに天気がいいんだし、\nきっときれいな初日の出が見れるよ！","zh":"嗯！天气这么好，\n一定能看到美丽的新年初升日出！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1694.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"b28c6e1992b3b622cf842d4905e774697c1aca99e4c544575a1e1ceddfdbd8e1","ja":"……あっ、律子さん！\nどうだった？","zh":"……啊，律子小姐！\n情况怎么样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1694.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"86ad08078d12481a39f7506ed97496ab0ded1463bbda2cb1d85c27a31c28f43f","ja":"とりあえず夕食は私と一緒に食べて、そのあと\n時間までに眠ってしまわなければ参加していいそうよ。","zh":"总之晚饭先和我一起吃，之后要是\n在规定时间之前没有睡着的话，就可以参加哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1694.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"120a3c9a9bfd122881a3b289b80bd5aed2355e46c895b37ac6255f26bed668d3","ja":"わ～い、やったぁ！\nぜったいねないで待ってようね、育！","zh":"哇～太棒啦！\n绝对不能睡着，一定要等下去哦，育！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1694.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"887a8e7ad59b05ed8334bf3e3ffacaa61642ce20bfaf1723644556ff47bf7487","ja":"うん！　きっと、楽しくって、\nねむくなんてならないよ！","zh":"嗯！肯定会很开心的，\n绝对不会犯困哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1694.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"876a663051fa370b8073f37ad2a792a83e52c268be002b5186192c97c581a4bd","ja":"ふふ。それじゃあ、まあまずは、\nあたたかいものでも食べにいきましょ♪","zh":"呵呵。那我们就先，\n去吃点热乎的东西吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
